# Drupal contribution workspace (Claude Code)

Read `.drupal-contrib/context.md` in full before contribution work. It contains the shared site table, workflow, and issue-record rules.

Resolve `<skills-root>` to `.claude/skills`. Start with `/drupal-issue-start <url>`.
Delegate the named roles using the installed `.claude/agents/` definitions.
Preserve approved scope and relay agent pauses to the human.

The installer prepares `.claude/settings.json`, a Git guardrail hook, and
project-scoped MCP configuration in `.mcp.json`. Approve the project MCP server
in Claude Code when prompted; check it with `/mcp`.
Resolve any `.drupal-contrib/proposals/` notices before relying on that configuration.
